VALUES (1245, 'tt0107943', NULL, 'The Remains of the Day', 'The Remains of the Day', 'movie', 1993, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDGDtqSvuch324WnM7Ukdp1bCAQ.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vFhxd3Z1zaV3Yu5XLpvWzSxJCe8.jpg', 'In interwar Britain, a rule-bound head butler''s world of manners and decorum in the household he maintains is tested by the arrival of a new housekeeper. The possibility of romance and his master''s cultivation of ties with the Nazi cause challenge his carefully maintained veneer of servitude.', NULL, NULL, 3.9098, 7.36, 0, 2.20182352941176446e+01, '2026-07-31 03:33:23', '2026-11-22 21:01:41')
