VALUES (10555, 'tt0307453', NULL, 'Shark Tale', 'Shark Tale', 'movie', 2004, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r08DpyPyhXcJTfNZAICNGMzcQ8l.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7ZmZxar3bYORcl0TPA4oceyxcaE.jpg', 'Oscar is a small fish whose big aspirations often get him into trouble. Meanwhile, Lenny is a great white shark with a surprising secret that no sea creature would guess: He''s a vegetarian. When a lie turns Oscar into an improbable hero and Lenny becomes an outcast, the two form an unlikely friendship.', NULL, NULL, 10.3413, 6.049, 0, 6.2775, '2026-08-09 02:29:31', '2026-11-22 21:01:41')
